# Per-user CLAUDE.md - real file lives at <vault>/persona/CLAUDE.md, symlinked
# into the repo root (Claude Code auto-loads CLAUDE.md from cwd). Template:
# CLAUDE.example.md. Setup wizard wires this up.
# CRON.md isn't here because it lives directly at <vault>/persona/CRON.md;
# bin/cron-daemon.ts reads $VAULT_PATH/persona/CRON.md, no repo-root copy.
CLAUDE.md

# Skills: most are personal/vault-backed and stay out of git. Track only
# the shared ones that should ship with the repo.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/assistant-loop/
!.claude/skills/assistant-test/
!.claude/skills/kb/

# Editor swap files
*.swp
*.swo
